Whether as a comforter for abdominal pain or simply for cuddling – my little heat friend is versatile.
Cherry core cushions are a traditional home remedy for soothing heat applications, as cherry kernels can absorb heat very well and dispense again.
The removable inner cushion can be easily heated in the microwave or in the oven.
The soft cover makes the application particularly pleasant so that the little ones feel safe, even if they aren’t doing so well.
The cherry core cushion with cover is only suitable for the following fields of application as a heat support:
Before heating the pillow, check for untypical odor, stick or burn spots and dispose immediately in the presence.
Please remove the inner cushion for heating out of the cover beforehand!
In the microwave at a maximum of 300 watts for a maximum of 2 minutes (observe information from the microwave manufacturer!)
Distribute the heat by shaking evenly in the cushion immediately after heating!
Then place the inner cushion in the cover.
During the first heatings, slight moisture formation can occur on the surface, but this disappears during repeated applications.
Be sure to follow the heating instructions, as longer periods or higher energy outputs can lead to damage (risk of ignition and combustion!).
Before heating the pillow in the microwave, check that heating of grain products is allowed in the manufacturer's instructions for use.
After the heated inner cushion has been placed back in the cover, please check the temperature of the pillow for suitability for babies (max. 43 °C) on your arm bend!
Don’t use the pillow for acute and chronic, inflammatory or feverable conditions, circulatory complaints, fresh hematomas, bruises and open wounds, as well as those with reduced pain.
For existing skin, heart, veins, diabetes or tumor diseases as well as pregnancy, please contact a doctor before administration.
If seams have opened and loose cores emerge, dispose of the product and the loose cores immediately and inaccessible for children.
If the product is used in babies under 1 year, the temperature of the child should be checked regularly during use in order to exclude overheating!
All serious incidents in connection with the product shall be reported to the manufacturer and the competent authority of the country in which the user is established.
The cover is detachable and washable at 30 °C in the machine.
Please note the care symbols on the product!
