A CD or MP3 player can be connected to the AUX jack, so you can jam to your favorite songs.
A tuner function is also on board - so you don't need a separate tuner.
If you also buy a VFS5 button, you can also conveniently access the sounds by foot, switch the effect blocks on/off and "tape" the tempo of the correspondingly compatible effects.
