We've come into a winter rigidity and extended the summer hole to a few months.
#Where is the problem?
Yes, what's the matter?
For the most part, this should simply be related to dissatisfaction, how some things have expired here and how we stand in general.
In the last few days there has been increasingly the impression that many here are really still interested in the Bundestag.
#What we need to change
At this point, the community around the Bundestag is asked who wants to keep it alive.
The impetus came from u/edizVEVO, who has become aware of this project in recent days and has found a, simply said, shambles.
After some writing back and forth, several people from the community have found themselves who want to rebuild the project.
However, I would also like to once again explicitly invite everyone to participate, only in this way can this project continue to exist in the future.
For this purpose, we have created a discussion platform in the form of a discord server, on which we can exchange each other, as well as work out concrete things.
You can join the server via this link.
