The decorative lamp blends harmoniously into any bed, garden area or rock garden.
The lamp is placed easily and can be anchored in the ground with skewers.
Built-in and powerful 0.4 watt solar module for optimal charging of the built-in battery.
Luminescent duration max. 10 hours
- The robust plastic version can be used outdoors all year round.
In the Hollywood spectacle, it's mostly threatening objects from distant galaxies that glow inwardly colorful.
On the other hand, “Smart Stone” is completely harmless: the sun alone ensures that this solar luminaire shines fascinatingly – either in white or coloured light (in six different shades).
The clueless, amorphous design is deliberately chosen: like a nature-formed large pebble, this modern light object presents itself by day.
Its organic curves fit into any natural environment – whether on the edge of the terrace, in the lawn or in the stone bed.
He also does well in the neighborhood of larger pebbles and boulders, where he knows how to assert himself thanks to his size.
You can save yourself great preparatory work: As a solar luminaire, »Smart Stone« does not require supply line or batteries.
Place the "liminous stone" in any square illuminated by the sun in the day.
Two included earth skewers provide a firm hold if necessary.
The matte white plastic sheath itself is robust and weatherproof.
Its solar module hides “Smart Stone” discreetly inside, together with its battery and two LEDs – one for white, the other for colored light.
The battery already charges when sunlight falls on the case.
At dusk at dusk, »Smart Stone« begins to glow automatically; in what color, you decide for yourself: Six attractive light colors – in addition to daylight white – are available to you.
Finally, switch-off takes place automatically as soon as the battery charging level has dropped to a predetermined minimum or it becomes bright again.
As soon as the sun shines again, the charging cycle starts from the front the next day.
